  <p id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p001:m0000" ref="59p_dir_tdq">檀祗</persName>字恭叔，高平金鄉人，左將軍<persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p001:m0015" ref="2v5_rhh_fd6">韶</persName>第二弟也。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p002:m0001" ref="59p_dir_tdq_A">獻</persName>嗣，元熙中卒，無子，<persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p002:m0012" ref="59p_dir_tdq">祗</persName>次子<persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p002:m0015" ref="59p_dir_tdq_B">朗</persName>紹封。<persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p002:m0019" ref="59p_dir_tdq_B">朗</persName>卒，子<persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p002:m0023" ref="59p_dir_tdq_BA">宣明</persName>嗣。<persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p002:m0027" ref="59p_dir_tdq_BA">宣明</persName>卒，子<persName id="c-songshu-047-tan-family-passages:p002:m0032" ref="59p_dir_tdq_BAA">逸</persName>嗣。齊受禪，國除。</p>
</text>
